Subject: [PATCH] util: include stat headers when building subst without config.h

The cross build compiles subst for the host without HAVE_CONFIG_H. Include
the headers that declare fstat and fchmod for modern host compilers.

--- a/util/subst.c
+++ b/util/subst.c
@@ -9,6 +9,8 @@
 #include "config.h"
 #else
 #define HAVE_SYS_TIME_H
+#define HAVE_SYS_TYPES_H
+#define HAVE_SYS_STAT_H
 #endif
 #include <stdio.h>
 #include <errno.h>
